    "description": "A web server is a computer system or software application that delivers web pages to users over the internet. It handles requests from clients, typically web browsers and responds by serving content like HTML pages, images, videos, or other files.\n\nPHP is able to be integrated in many webservers: ``nginx``, ``Apache``, ``Caddy``, ``lighthttpd``, ``Litespeed``, etc.\n\nPHP is able to run in server mode. In command line, use the ``-S`` option.",
